  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting stuff 8': Endor Operations (posted 'Endor Operations/...'), Endor, Bunker, Landing Platform, Prepared Defenses ('Prepared Defences'), Imperial Arrest Order, 'Battle Plan' and Mobilization Points; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so none is set.",
  "The machine draft read 'Endor Operations/...' as Endor Occupation and the section headers 'Starting stuff 8', 'Starships/Vehicles 5' and 'Interruupts 10' as cards; fixed. The posted section counts (8/3/19/5/3/10/12) add to 60.",
  "Posted 'Battle Plan' (the Light Endor Effect) dested Battle Order, the Dark Endor counterpart, since this is a Dark deck.",
